Third-party components and data

This repository intentionally does not redistribute third-party binaries.
Analysis write-ups that discuss a publicly distributed challenge binary
reference it by name and cryptographic hash rather than including the file, so
that the original author's distribution terms remain the only ones that apply to
it. See docs/CORPUS.md for how to obtain the samples a write-up refers to.

Where a module implements a published file format or algorithm, the
specification it follows is cited in that module's docstring.
